   "tender": {
    "id": "tender_469927/1451115",
    "title": "Energy Retail Markets Legal Advice and Services",
    "description": "Provision of legal advice in relation to electricity and gas supplier financial difficulties, insolvencies and subsequent government response which may include, but not be limited to: the Supplier of Last Resort \r\n(SoLR) process, requirements for a Special Administration Regime (SAR) and wider considerations related to supplier failure and \r\nmarket stability. In the case of a SAR, this would need to be established very quickly, and short notice legal work would be required \r\nahead of the actual initiation of a SAR. Any delay accessing legal support under such circumstances risks a disorderly exit from the \r\nmarket, risking the continued supply of energy to customers, and having wider repercussions on retail and wholesale markets.",
